ect has a single property of type string for Email (for simplicity that's all an Address has)   A Student \"has a\" CreditsEarned property 10 pts: A Student \"has a\" Gpa property that can express overall grades with exactly 2 decimal points, such as 3.87, etc.  Use data attributes to insure that Email addresses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":211972,"global_rank":273743},{"name":"trogers-twilio/plugin-sfdc-opencti-sample","owner":"trogers-twilio","html_url":"https://github.com/trogers-twilio/plugin-sfdc-opencti-sample","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":22,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Sample Salesforce Open CTI calls from a Flex Plugin","topics":[],"score":211971,"global_rank":273744},{"name":"aerobatic/swagger-ui-demo","owner":"aerobatic","html_url":"https://github.com/aerobatic/swagger-ui-demo","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Aerobatic swagger-ui demo","topics":["aerobatic","react","swagger-ui"],"score":211969,"global_rank":273745},{"name":"oerdal/paphi","owner":"oerdal","html_url":"https://github.com/oerdal/paphi","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Repo for Pi Alpha Phi House Website","topics":[],"score":211969,"global_rank":273746},{"name":"laijiang19/watchout","owner":"laijiang19","html_url":"https://github.com/laijiang19/watchout","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211965,"global_rank":273757},{"name":"MollsReis/nsqfun","owner":"MollsReis","html_url":"https://github.com/MollsReis/nsqfun","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"lang